        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮Vietnam Warrior: Against the US Invasion is a pixel-art action game that recreates the Vietnamese people's resistance war against the US through the lens of a guerrilla fighter. The game is not only entertaining but also an emotional historical journey, taking players back to the Vietnam War period with fierce battles, guerrilla tactics, and the indomitable spirit of the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 Historical setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by the Vietnam War (1955–1975), especially the peak of the resistance against the US invasion. Players take on the role of a soldier of the Southern Liberation Army, fighting in jungles, tunnels, and fierce battlefields such as Truong Son, Khe Sanh, Hue, and Saigon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: 2D action, side-scrolling shooter, combining tactical elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mode: Single-player story-driven, with the option to expand survival or co-op mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons &amp; Equipment: AK guns, B40s, mines, tunnels, and guerrilla combat tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment: Tropical jungles, villages, US military bases, Cu Chi tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical interaction: Players will participate in famous battles such as Tet Mau Than 1968, Ho Chi Minh Campaign 1975, and can meet historical figures such as General Vo Nguyen Giap or Uncle Ho through dialogues or special missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic pixel art: Reminiscent of retro games but with deep content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlefield sounds: Helicopter sounds, artillery fire, and revolutionary music create a realistic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patriotic message: Honoring the fighting spirit, courage, and sacrifice of our ancestors. </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮Vietnam Warrior: Against the US Invasion is a pixel-art action game that recreates the Vietnamese people's resistance war against the US through the lens of a guerrilla fighter. The game is not only entertaining but also an emotional historical journey, taking players back to the Vietnam War period with fierce battles, guerrilla tactics, and the indomitable spirit of the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 Historical setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by the Vietnam War (1955–1975), especially the peak of the resistance against the US invasion. Players take on the role of a soldier of the Southern Liberation Army, fighting in jungles, tunnels, and fierce battlefields such as Truong Son, Khe Sanh, Hue, and Saigon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: 2D action, side-scrolling shooter, combining tactical elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mode: Single-player story-driven, with the option to expand survival or co-op mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons &amp; Equipment: AK guns, B40s, mines, tunnels, and guerrilla combat tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment: Tropical jungles, villages, US military bases, Cu Chi tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical interaction: Players will participate in famous battles such as Tet Mau Than 1968, Ho Chi Minh Campaign 1975, and can meet historical figures such as General Vo Nguyen Giap or Uncle Ho through dialogues or special missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic pixel art: Reminiscent of retro games but with deep content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlefield sounds: Helicopter sounds, artillery fire, and revolutionary music create a realistic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patriotic message: Honoring the fighting spirit, courage, and sacrifice of our ancestors. </p>",
